    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KM PROPERTY is delighted to welcome you to Apartment 96 Seapark, a spacious and light-filled dual aspect first-floor apartment located in this highly regarded development on Mount Prospect Avenue, Clontarf, Dublin 3. Offering a generous footprint of approximately 62 sq.m., this bright apartment features two large double bedrooms, a full bathroom with shower, and immaculate interiors throughout.\n\n \n\nVideo viewing: https://youtu.be/sAv9kQfCPBg\n\nInternally, the property comprises an entrance hallway / utility area, leading to an expansive open-plan living and dining area. This dual-aspect apartment is filled with natural light, enhanced by large South facing windows that overlook Mount Prospect Avenue. The separate, upgraded kitchen is fitted with wall & floor units and a tiled finish, offering ample storage and workspace. \n\nBoth double bedrooms are generously sized with large windows and built in wardrobes, and the bathroom is fitted with a walk-in electric shower. The property is finished with laminate flooring throughout, creating a clean and modern feel.\n\n \n\nSituated on beautifully maintained communal green spaces, Seapark offers peace and privacy while being just moments from everything Clontarf has to offer. The location provides easy access to local supermarket-Nolan`s, and an abundance of cafes, restaurants, and specialist food stores, along with Clontarf Promenade and the expansive St. Anne`s Park for outdoor leisure.\n\n The area is well serviced with public transport, with the 130-bus route on your doorstep and Clontarf Road and Killester DART stations nearby. The property also offers quick access to Dublin Airport, the M1, M50, East Point Business Park, and Dublin City Centre. For sports lovers, the area is home to numerous clubs, including Clontarf Rugby & Cricket Club, GAA, tennis, sailing, hockey, and several top-class golf courses.\n\nFor further details or to arrange a private viewing, contact KM Property today at info@kmproperty.ie."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 2.9m (9'6\") x 1.17m (3'10\")\nBeautifully presented with window for natural light. Currently used as a convenient utility area.\n\nLiving Room - 4.35m (14'3\") x 3.81m (12'6\")\nA bright and spacious living room featuring a large, South facing window that overlooks Mount Prospect Avenue. Beautiful decor throughout.\n\nKitchen - 2.93m (9'7\") x 2.89m (9'6\")\nFully upgraded kitchen with a sleek design. Laminate flooring and tiled walls.\n\nHallway - 1.57m (5'2\") x 0.9m (2'11\")\nGives access to the two bedrooms and bathroom.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.37m (14'4\") x 3.34m (10'11\")\nVery generous double bedroom with plenty of built in wardrobes, South facing window overlooking Mount Prospect Avenue.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.93m (12'11\") x 2.68m (8'10\")\nSpacious double bedroom with window overlooking the expansive, communal, green area. This room benefits from built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.89m (9'6\") x 1.58m (5'2\")\nFully upgraded bathroom, walk in electric shower, WC and WHB.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
